	 *         had a ledger or never existed — the two are the same read here, and telling them
	 *         apart is the caller's, which has the Transfer
	 * @throws org.springframework.transaction.IllegalTransactionStateException if the caller
	 *                                                                         has no
	 *                                                                         transaction
	 *                                                                         open
	 */
